      "What do You Watch, Chinese or English TV Shows?",
      "",
      "Paul: What do you like to do when you’re not working?",
      "",
      "Annie: I like watching TV shows.",
      "",
      "Paul: I like that as well! But in China most shows on TV are in Chinese. I don’t understand.",
      "",
      "Annie: Don’t worry. You can try watching TV shows on the Internet. There are many free English TV shows.",
      "",
      "Paul: Really? That’s great!",
      "",
      "Annie: But I think you should spend more time watching Chinese TV shows.",
      "You will know about what Chinese people like, what they don’t like, what they want and what they hate.",
      "",
